<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:144%;">MemMachine: A Ground-Truth-Preserving Memory System
<br class="ltx_break">for Personalized AI Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
